    {
        "content": "<p>Note that <code>set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false</code> makes the first example work, so there is probably some reducibility problem in the way <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=IsLocalRing.ResidueField#doc\">docs#IsLocalRing.ResidueField</a> is set up.</p>",
